WEBVTT

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.380
Let's Go: Banana!

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:09.450
Time to ea-

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.450
Hello!

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:13.320
Hey, Akane-chan, guess what? There's this boy I have a crush on...

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.420
For real?! Do I know 'im?!

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.340
Well...

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:17.930
Come on, ya've gotta tell me!

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:22.280
He's strong, kind, and everyone loves him!

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:26.470
Well, knowin' you and your fairytales, Miyuki, it's probably Peter Pan, right?

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:27.260
Nope!

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.090
Nope? Then...

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:32.110
Miyuki's finally fallen in love with a real boy?!

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.280
Oh, the one I love is...

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.790
The boy from the legend who's born from a peach, Momotarou!

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:41.350
That's just another one of your fairytale characters again!

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.750
That's great!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.190
Why have they been having the same conversation over and over again?

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:48.890
It's material!

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:50.860
Material...?

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.530
We're practicing our stand-up routine!

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:57.330
'Cause tomorrow's the Nanairogaoka Mall Comedy Contest!

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:59.630
And you know who the special guests are?

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:04.100
The stand-up legends, FUJIWARA!

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.660
Whoa!

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.160
Who is this Fujiwara-san?

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:08.180
Kuru?

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.380
You serious?! You dunno 'em?!

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.510
Their names are Fujimoto and Haranishi, see!

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:15.320
They're this really popular stand-up duo! They're on TV and everything!

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:19.060
Man, gettin' to perform in front of them's like a dream come true!

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:20.120
A'ight!

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:24.410
We're gonna win that comedy contest!

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:30.380
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.220
Smile Precure!

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:33.120
Let's go!

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:34.660
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:35.790
All together!

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:37.390
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:39.590
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:42.300
Smile Precure!

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:47.100
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:52.540
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:57.750
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:03.680
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:08.620
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:08.590
So bright!

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:13.790
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:20.230
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.740
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:21.900
Let's go!

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:24.610
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:27.540
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:32.350
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:32.910
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:34.580
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:35.720
Everybody!

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.390
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:39.920
Fly to the future!

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:43.420
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:45.590
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:47.900
Smile Precure!

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:56.460
Hey!

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.990
What're you making-oni?

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.660
Just don't bother me, alright? Buzz off-da wasa!

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:03.360
Huh? What's this?

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:07.730
"Comedy Contest, with special guests FUJIWARA, the legendary stand-up duo..."

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:11.200
Apparently, they're incredibly famous comedians-da wasa!

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:14.510
Oh man, don't tell me you're scared of these dweebs?

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:20.520
This isn't funny-da wasa! They say that Haranishi man knows a trillion jokes-da wasa!

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:21.160
What?!

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:22.080
You're kidding!

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:26.220
If they do show up, the entire town will be filled with smiles and laughter-da wasa!

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:29.690
That'd be bad-oni! We've gotta go beat them up-oni!

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:32.660
That's why I'm making these-da wasa!

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:35.260
Finally, my work is complete-da wasa!

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:40.380
We're not letting her hog the glory!

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:42.110
Come on, we're going too!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:42.800
Oni?!

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.760
We're gonna be a double act... and we'll be called...

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:48.130
The Bad End Bombers!

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:49.840
Sounds cool-oni!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:03.790
Alright! Finally time for the comedy contest!

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:05.560
Where're you going, Akane-chan?

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:07.050
I'm gonna go backstage!

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:10.260
This is the best chance I'm gonna get to get FUJIWARA's autographs!

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:12.310
I don't think you should just barge in there...

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.230
I'm with Reika.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.600
Autographs!

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.800
Yayoi-san...

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:20.050
I guess this is it...

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:22.170
Uh, 'scuse me?

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:25.110
Are FUJIWARA back here?

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:25.940
Huh?

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.460
You're...!

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.180
Who is he?

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.820
It's Fujimoto from FUJIWARA, ya dolt!

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:36.460
You girls helping organize or something?

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.300
We're performing, actually!

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:40.860
I'm a big fan of FUJIWARA, see...

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:44.180
Oh, really? Aww, shucks.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.400
Ain't Haranishi with ya?

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:48.830
Nah, he vamoosed a bit back.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.530
But knowing him and his sense of direction, we could be waiting a while.

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:54.090
Yay! Ni hao!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:57.930
He's...!

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.380
And who might this be?

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:04.030
C'est moi! Hoorah, ici, Hara-nishi!

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.580
It's him!

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:06.920
That's great!

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:10.120
The heck have you been, man? I've been looking all over for you!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:14.200
Huh, really? Shucks, man, can you forgive me?

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.840
I'm begging you!

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.260
That's not begging! That's not anything!

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:23.590
So, you girls fans of ours?

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.740
Yeah! We're huge, huge, huge fans!

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:30.010
I can't think why nice girls like you would be fans of ours...

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:32.540
It's cause I've got such a big head!

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.710
Aww man, there's the big head gag!

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:35.750
I can't believe they're fans!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.890
I don't really think it's appropriate to laugh about that.

00:05:37.890 --> 00:05:41.000
No, see, it's just one of Fujimoto-san's gags.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:41.850
Gags...?

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:44.950
Hey, is it true ya have a trillion gags, Haranishi-san?

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.090
Sure is!

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:47.490
Wanna come see 'em backstage?

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.960
You mean it?! Sure, course we do!

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:55.420
Whoa, we're really backstage!

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:57.820
Do try and show some etiquette, please.

00:05:57.820 --> 00:05:59.270
Haranishi-san, Fujimoto-san!

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:00.240
Can I get your autograph?

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:01.500
Can I shake your hands?!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.850
Can I take my photo with ya?!

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:05.380
Thank you so much!

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:08.100
Oh, hey, would ya tell us what ya think of this material we wrote?

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:09.350
I really want your advice!

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:10.920
Stop pestering them, Akane.

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:13.060
Yeah! Stop hogging them, Akane-chan!

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.150
That's not what I...

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:16.220
Perhaps we should leave them to it?

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:18.360
But I still wanna get their autographs!

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:20.050
Me too-kuru!

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.630
Did... Did that plushie of yours just talk?

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:27.550
Nope, it didn't talk! Not at all!

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:28.940
I totally saw it talk!

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:33.440
N-Nope! It's just, uh...

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:34.740
ventriloquism!

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:36.540
Ventriloquism?!

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:39.580
My name's Candy-kuru!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.050
Nice to meet you-kuru!

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:43.010
Your mouth's movin' too much, Miyuki!

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:44.880
And I'm not a plushie-kuru!

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.560
Yup, Candy's tooootally not a plushie-kuru!

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:50.080
But then what could she be?

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:52.320
I fear this hasn't been a very good display of ventriloquism.

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:56.670
You girls are pretty good!

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:57.830
You could make it as comedians!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:00.670
Huh? But ya haven't even heard our material yet..

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:01.530
We can tell, though!

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:04.160
You've got the straight man/funny man dynamic down pat!

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:06.510
You five should enter the contest together!

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:08.140
Wait, us too?!

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:09.910
Enter the comedy contest...?

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:11.070
That might be fun!

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:13.510
Alright then! We'll do a 5-man stand-up routine!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:15.650
We need a name first, though...

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:16.680
Yeah, good point!

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:17.620
Let's do that first!

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.970
Ya remember when we were choosin' our Precure catchphrase...?

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:23.290
What was that again? It was like...

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:29.230
Without further ado, let's begin the Nanairogaoka Mall Comedy Contest!

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:34.420
Our first entrant is Dynamite Barbecue! Enjoy!

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:35.430
Hi everyone!

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:37.980
We're Dynamite Barbecue!

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:38.900
Boom!

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.610
That's amazing!

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:44.940
Go on! Ask me what I had for dinner last night!

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.350
Oh, lemme guess. A barbecue?

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:47.610
What?! How did you know?!

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.350
Oh, I'm so nervous-oni!

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.050
Don't get stage fright now!

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:58.290
Everybody welcome our next act: The Bad End Bombers!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:56.480
We're gonna take this contest by storm!

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:57.220
Let's go!

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:58.990
Here they are!

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:10.270
A Comedy Contest?! Don't make us laugh!

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:13.780
Your world doesn't need all this stupid laughter!

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:15.710
Yeah, yeah!

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:18.580
Let me tell you something about the story of Momotarou!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:20.570
The oni's! Meant! To win!

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:26.230
This entire world will face a Bad End soon enough!

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:33.970
Well... that was the Bad End Bombers there.

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:36.270
We haven't even started scaring you yet!

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:38.260
And I've gotta tell them about the story of Momotarou-oni!

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:41.230
What do those two think they're playing at-da wasa?

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:44.700
Okay, nope! This is bad comedy!

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:51.640
Your wigs are pretty stylish, but I can't tell who's meant to be the straight man.

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:53.640
Back to the drawing board, I guess!

00:08:53.640 --> 00:08:54.810
Thanks for coming!

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:57.770
This pisses me off-oni!

00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:59.590
It's fine, we did what we had to.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:03.220
We've put a chill on those humans' mood, after all!

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:05.190
Mission complete!

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:09.110
What was with that double act?

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.330
How you doin'?

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.420
I'm really nervous...

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:16.140
Next up we have a lively performance by our third entry: GoPrecure!

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:13.470
Me too...

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:16.140
Hey, it's gonna be okay! Come on!

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.710
If you please!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.100
Miyuki!

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:23.250
Hey, Miyuki!

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:24.480
It's me, Dad!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:27.690
D-Dad?! And Mom too?!

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:30.650
Don't mess up, Nee-chan!

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:34.050
Shut up! Just lemme get on with it!

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.400
We're G-G-GoPrecure...

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:41.660
Thank you all for comi-

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:45.100
Ow! Hapupu...

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:48.270
Hapupu, really?!

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:52.240
Miyuki-chan, Akane, you can do it!

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:54.370
Oh, right, my cue!

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:59.210
S-Say, Akane-chan... There's this boy I have a crush on!

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:03.780
R-Really? Do I know 'em?

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:04.600
Yeah...

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:05.960
Who is it, who is it?

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.310
They're really strong, and kind...

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:10.820
Well, knowin' you and your fairytales, Miyuki...

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:13.090
It's M-Momotarou!

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.790
You ruined it, Yayoi-chan!

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:19.260
I-I'm sorry, I forgot!

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:21.830
They're killing me!

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:25.800
I was under the impression you had a crush on Peter Pan, Miyuki-san.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:26.890
Reika!

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.110
Stick to the script!

00:10:28.110 --> 00:10:31.880
But isn't that what you said that night on our field trip?

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:34.080
Or were you lying to us?

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:39.720
Okay, time out!

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.620
We're starting over!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.370
Well, thank you, GoPrecure!

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:53.430
We'll be taking a short break now!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.640
You girls were pretty funny up there!

00:10:57.640 --> 00:11:01.340
But it didn't go the way we planned at all...

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.540
It seems the path of comedy still eludes me...

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:06.010
Reika...

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:09.050
Sorry... It was my fault...

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:10.480
Don't blame yourself, Yayoi!

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:13.810
I should blame myself for draggin' ya all into this...

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:16.400
I love comedy, so I thought I should give it a go, but...

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.820
I guess that ain't enough to carry me!

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:20.730
That ain't true at all!

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:21.590
Huh?

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:26.570
If it's really something you love, have a good think about why you love it.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:31.000
Now then, it's time for a performance from our special guests!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.270
Alright, we're up!

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:35.340
Just watch us perform...

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:36.910
the thing we love most in life!

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:46.950
I don't think so, somehow-da wasa!

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:52.510
Sunny!

00:11:58.430 --> 00:11:59.270
Akanbe!

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:04.800
Now then, it's time for our special guests, FUJIWARA!

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:13.630
Hi everyone! We're FUJIWARA!

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:14.800
Go!

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:22.930
It seems we have a <i>very reasonably sized audience</i> here today.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:26.390
It's cause I've got such a <i>perfectly reasonably-sized head.</i>

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:29.290
Where'd their accents go...?

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:33.580
Say, Haranishi-kun, how many gags do you know, anyway?

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:35.310
<i>Around five. Maybe six.</i>

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:38.660
But did they not just say he knew a trillion...?

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.730
H-How about using one, then?!

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:43.970
A-Alright, here's my best gag!

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:46.440
Seriously, where are their accents?

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.270
<i>Jubilations! I'm here, Haranishi.</i>

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.950
It's meant to rhyme! Hoorah, ici, Hara-nishi!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:56.420
The heck? They're not normally this bad...

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.180
It's meant to be "C'est moi! Hoorah, ici, Hara-nishi!"!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:13:00.290
The audience seems mad, Haranishi-kun. Give them your trademark apology!

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:03.660
<i>I'm genuinely quite sorry. I'm begging you, forgive me!</i>

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.520
He's just apologizing normally!

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:07.290
That's not how the gag goes!

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:09.260
And now, to finish this-da wasa!

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:13.100
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.070
a Bad End-da wasa!

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:19.170
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-da wasa!

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.300
We're finished...

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:29.310
We can't perform anymore...

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:33.500
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans...

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:38.600
will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, Pierrot-sama, da wasa!

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:44.900
Majorina-kuru!

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:46.170
You did this!

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:47.270
What tha heck did you do?!

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:49.080
Those necklaces are my latest creation...

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:50.740
Unfunnyizers-da wasa!

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:52.440
Unfunnyizers?!

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:57.140
When you're wearing them, everything you say becomes totally and utterly incapable of amusement-da wasa!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.540
That's awful!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.250
Yer not gonna get away with it!

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.480
Let's take her down!

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:03.280
Right!

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.580
Ready!

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:11.630
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:12.680
Go!

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:14.930
Go, go!

00:14:15.390 --> 00:14:16.710
Let's go!

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:48.090
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:51.090
Cure Happy!

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:56.020
Dazzling sun!

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:57.830
Hot-blooded power!

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:00.430
Cure Sunny!

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:06.240
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:09.150
Cure Peace!

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:14.970
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:17.940
Cure March!

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:23.990
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.720
Cure Beauty!

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:31.320
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:41.880
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.030
Precure...?

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:50.120
Two for the price of one, today! A red and blue double whammy-da wasa!

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:51.960
Come forth, Akanbe!

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.330
Akanbe!

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:00.230
Akanbe!

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:02.040
She used FUJIWARA's billboards!

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.200
The heck are you doin'?!

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:04.520
Akan!

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:05.840
Akan!

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:07.810
You two ain't gonna beat us!

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:12.180
I've got such a big head!

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:15.640
Hoorah!

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:16.170
Ici!

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:16.840
It's...

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:18.850
a-me, Akanbe!

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:23.390
What's that supposed to be?

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:25.020
Akanbe!

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:27.790
Akanbe!

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:29.760
I'm... trapped!

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:31.600
You're just rippin' off FUJIWARA's jokes!

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:35.860
This comedy is pointless! Pointless, I say-da wasa!

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:40.910
I'm doing you a favor by ridding your world of smiles and happiness-da wasa!

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:42.910
I don't think so!

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:46.850
Comedy... is about making people happy!

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:51.300
Yeah! We're not gonna let you make these people sad!

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:52.430
What?!

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:53.490
FUJIWARA-san...

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:57.460
How did you manage to regain yourselves in my Bad End Space-da wasa?!

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:59.460
You wanna know?

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:01.670
It's cause I've got such a big head!

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:03.330
They're back to normal!

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:06.630
The size of your noggin has nothing to do with it-da wasa!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.880
Wait... why aren't my Unfunnyizers working-da wasa?!

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.300
You really need to ask?

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.870
It's because we're the greatest stand-up duo of all time...

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:16.810
We are FUJIWARA!

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.310
Are you alright, Precure?

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:23.750
Let us fight too! What should we do?!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.840
Wait... could you be the sixth Precure-kuru?!

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:29.550
Now hang on a sec! Why's that plushieie talking?!

00:17:29.550 --> 00:17:31.330
I'm not a plushie-kuru!

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:34.640
Quickly! Shout "Precure, Smile Charge!" and transform-kuru!

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:37.020
Alright, let's do it!

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:38.720
Wait, seriously?

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.890
Ready!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:46.060
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:59.030
Natural power, born of bestial spirit!

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:00.610
Cure Gorilla!

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:05.790
What are you DOING?! You can't transform, ya doofus!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.430
That's great-da wasa!

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:10.200
Akanbe!

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:12.930
Akanbe!

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:16.270
What are you doing, Akanbe?!

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:18.740
You get it now?! This is the power of laughter!

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:21.360
The power of laughter...

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:31.020
<i>If it's really something you love, have a good think about why you love it.</i>

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:35.920
Yeah... now I remember why I love comedy...

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:39.390
Akanbe! Take them all down, pronto-da wasa!

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:41.410
Akan...

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:42.830
be!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:49.700
Precure?

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:57.340
What matters is that I love making people happy! It's just like making okonomiyaki!

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:59.810
Wait, are you that girl from before?!

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:04.080
Don't tell anyone about this, alright, guys?

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:09.130
Wh-Whoa...

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:11.640
Now I got that down, I can take you down too!

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:12.990
Akanbe!

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:20.900
Akanbe!

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:25.530
Precure...

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:30.870
Sunny Fire!

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:39.280
Akanbe...

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:43.790
What?!

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:45.220
Alright!

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:47.520
Akanbe!

00:19:55.370 --> 00:19:56.470
Why does this always happen-da wasa?!

00:19:57.770 --> 00:20:03.210
FUJIWARA's helped to keep people smiling! Now it's our turn!

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:07.110
Now, combine your powers-kuru!

00:20:13.970 --> 00:20:15.120
Let's go!

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:24.970
Precure...

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:29.840
Rainbow...

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:32.010
Healing!

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:36.900
Akanbe...

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:44.800
Nice one!

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:46.220
You did it, Precure!

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:49.150
It's the Sports Décor-kuru!

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:53.510
That makes fourteen Décors-kuru!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:58.100
I've had enough of your comedy for today-da wasa!

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:03.570
Man, we've got a huge audience today!

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.300
It's cause I've got such a big head!

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:07.270
What does that have to do with anything?!

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:11.020
You know, I was wondering, why on earth my daughter is so cute.

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:13.450
Oh, that's cause <i>she's</i> got such a big head!

00:21:14.470 --> 00:21:15.910
Thank you, girls.

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.720
That was quite a mess you got us out of!

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:19.990
We should be thankin' you!

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:23.360
You guys taught me a really valuable lesson, ya know?

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:25.590
Our job, as FUJIWARA...

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:27.490
is to make people smile!

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:29.190
And ours, as Precure...

00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:31.620
is to make sure no-one stops them!

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:35.100
Ah, hey... about us being Precure and all...

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:36.910
Don't worry, it's our secret!

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:43.660
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:46.240
Natural power, born of bestial spirit!

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:47.370
Cure Gorilla!

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:49.680
You can't transform, you doofus!

00:21:50.520 --> 00:21:53.030
Some secret!

00:21:53.030 --> 00:21:55.990
They're usin' it as material!

00:23:39.460 --> 00:23:42.460
It's sports day! And who else is running the girls relay but Nao-chan?

00:23:42.460 --> 00:23:43.820
She's fast on her feet, after all!

00:23:43.820 --> 00:23:47.360
I like running and everything, but competition isn't really my thing...

00:23:47.930 --> 00:23:49.670
I still think you should do it, Nao.

00:23:49.670 --> 00:23:52.870
Yeah, agreed! I'd just lose if I tried...

00:23:53.470 --> 00:23:55.780
Well, why don't the five of us run it together?

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:57.040
What?!

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:58.470
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.150 --> 00:24:03.740
Find your ultra happy smile!
